1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,490
Hi, I'm Viola Zeneli, from team Viola Fusion.

2
00:00:02,550 --> 00:00:06,770
Every summer, Albania burns,
so for NASA's hot spots challenge, I built VATRA.

3
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:11,880
Switch between NASA's MODIS, VIIRS and harmonized data,
for any county and dates.

4
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:15,200
In 2012, VIIRS made counts jump 194 percent.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:18,420
In VATRA, fires fell 29 percent.

6
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,970
Or draw your own area on the map.

7
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:21,400
There's even a game for kids.

8
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:22,950
Ask Viola, the guide, anything.

9
00:00:23,010 --> 00:00:25,000
It's open on Zenodo, so firefighters can plan ahead,

10
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,240
and any country can reuse it.
